---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const features=[['Content that stays portable','Pages and media remain ordinary project files, so your work is useful outside any one interface.'],['Repository connection','Open a local folder or clone an existing repository, then keep its status and history close at hand.'],['Safe editing','Create, rename, move, and refine pages while the editor keeps the project structure valid.'],['Media library','Add images and other media in one place and reference them cleanly in content.'],['Local preview','See the static website before publishing it.'],['Languages and direction','Use English or Hebrew writing flows with the appropriate reading direction.'],['Git synchronization','Review changes, commit meaningful work, push, and recover from history.'],['Publishing targets','Build static output suitable for GitHub Pages and Cloudflare Pages.']];
---
<Base title="Learning Site features"><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Features</p><h1>Everything needed to run a serious learning site.</h1><p class="lede">The editor handles the repetitive publishing work so you can spend attention on material, structure, and students.</p></section><section class="feature-grid">{features.map(([title,copy], index)=><article><span>0{index+1}</span><h2>{title}</h2><p>{copy}</p></article>)}</section></Base>
